WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:06.130
A single strike

00:00:07.639 --> 00:00:09.639
could reshape our world

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:13.080
and the only thing that can stop it

00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:17.500
is science

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:24.780
It wasn't until a couple hundred years ago we even knew that asteroids existed

00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:28.620
finding asteroids before they find us is critical

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:35.980
We use telescopes to take pictures of the night sky

00:00:36.649 --> 00:00:39.189
a moving point of light reveals an asteroid

00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:43.560
we use this radio dish antenna from the Raider echo

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:46.880
we can determine their shape, orbit, and size

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:53.600
preventing an asteroid strike requires engineers of every discipline and a lot of teamwork

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:56.530
No idea is too crazy

00:00:59.269 --> 00:01:01.269
IMAX invites you

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:04.600
to learn about the science

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:07.790
the technology

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:12.500
and the heroes who are Earth's secret weapons

